Description: High-performance USB drive partitioning and formatting utility
 ParsLinux Formatter is a powerful, safe and multi-interface USB storage
 formatting utility for ParsLinux, supporting FAT32, NTFS, exFAT, EXT4,
 BTRFS, XFS, and F2FS with 5-layer kernel disk protection.
